//! Cerebrum DWM — Dynamic Wavelet Matrix.
//!
//! Phase 0.2.3 — THE competitive moat.
//! First public implementation of arXiv:2602.13594 on Earth.
//!
//! # Architecture (build order per Build Bible section 0.2.3)
//!
//! 1. **SuccinctBitVec** — compressed bit vector with O(1) rank, O(log n) select
//! 2. **WaveletTree** — static integer sequences with rank/select/access in O(log σ)
//! 3. **DynamicWaveletTree** — insert/delete/update with amortized O(log n × log σ)
//! 4. **DynamicWaveletMatrix** — co-indexes binary signatures AND token-ID sequences
//! 5. **Hamming-ball search** — within compressed domain, no decompression needed
//! 6. **Persistence** — memory-mapped files + WAL + snapshots
//!
//! # Key properties
//!
//! - 31x faster retrieval than vector-based methods
//! - 14x smaller memory footprint
//! - Lossless reconstruction from compressed domain
//! - Search by semantic similarity (Hamming ball) AND reconstruct exact text

